sequenceDiagram
actor Farmer as Farmer
participant AccountPage as Boundary: AccountPage
participant AuthenticationSessionControl as Control: AuthenticationSessionControl
participant User as Entity: User
Farmer->>AccountPage: Submit account change
AccountPage->>AuthenticationSessionControl: Verify current password and input
AuthenticationSessionControl->>User: Update user and session version
User-->>AuthenticationSessionControl: Return updated account state
AuthenticationSessionControl-->>AccountPage: Issue fresh token
AccountPage-->>Farmer: Confirm secure change
